Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(process): the camcraft-mcp skill's tool signatures
 match the server, pinned by a drift test (#724)

Eight entries in .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md named arguments the
server refuses (post path -> output, add_operation model -> source,
set_stock's kind/corner-array shape -> box {dx, dy, dz} / cylinder /
from_model, set_operation_area and set_operation_geometry name ->
operation (area is one object), set_work_offset offset -> word,
load_machine name -> builtin/path/clear, add_tool name -> catalog). The
Known Remaining Gaps list is brought current: pocket recognition, in-plane
part axes and the live GUI session have shipped; MoveModel and RepairModel
are open PRs #719 and #721.

crates/app/tests/mcp_skill_signatures.rs checks every documented signature
against tools/list (tool exists, keys are real, required keys written).
PROCESS_VERSION 4 -> 5.

